    "ruleType": "detachment-rule",
    "group": "Creations of Bile",
    "summary": "As the battle opens, assign lasting augmentations to your HERETIC ASTARTES INFANTRY models other than DAMNED. Pick one augmentation or roll two D6 for two results. A WARLORD named FABIUS BILE lets you reroll either die or both on the random route. Applying an augmentation twice adds no benefit. 1 - Cholinergic Accelerants gives melee weapons +1 Attacks. 2 - Hyperadrenal Infusion adds 2\" Move. 3 - Paraneural Reactions improves Weapon Skill by 1 in melee. 4 - Supracutaneous Chitination gives a 1-point Toughness improvement. 5 - Macrotensile Sinews gives melee weapons +1 Strength. 6 - Ophthalmic Enhancement gives a 1-point improvement to Ballistic Skill for ranged weapons.",
